{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a robotic version of Anubis in a mysterious place. You are confused and you have no memories. Explore the trial grounds, try to survive the &quot;carefully crafted&quot; challenges and discover who is behind all this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo also serves as a prologue for the story of the game. (Demologue?)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU A ROBOT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you are, maybe not. You need to discover your inner self to find out. Or just check the game's main store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO SHIELDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can use one shield. Two at once though, that requires some skill. They have modifiable functions and you can literally launch them from your arms. They can be used to block enemy attacks as well, obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OTHER ROBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, your enemies are robots that are based on Egyptian mythology. Face off against many different types of robots (at least three). Use your abilities and your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE ARE PUZZLES TOO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might be too many. They are also (mostly) physics based but physics may freak out. Please don't break the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063420?t=1759333653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063420?t=1759333653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/5f58c4d2ea2588af63f5a08be3a4e5b773465b8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759333653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/5f58c4d2ea2588af63f5a08be3a4e5b773465b8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759333653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a robotic version of Anubis in a mysterious place. You are confused and you have no memories. Explore the trial grounds, try to survive the &quot;carefully crafted&quot; challenges and discover who is behind all this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo also serves as a prologue for the story of the game. (Demologue?)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU A ROBOT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you are, maybe not. You need to discover your inner self to find out. Or just check the game's main store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO SHIELDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can use one shield. Two at once though, that requires some skill. They have modifiable functions and you can literally launch them from your arms. They can be used to block enemy attacks as well, obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OTHER ROBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, your enemies are robots that are based on Egyptian mythology. Face off against many different types of robots (at least three). Use your abilities and your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE ARE PUZZLES TOO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might be too many. They are also (mostly) physics based but physics may freak out. Please don't break the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.poster.avif?t=1759333653\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.webm?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.mp4?t=1759333653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Experigon SoftWorks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3802050","name":"Timeless Artifact: mechAnubis"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063420/b3ee9cd3dea9d556ba1d76212fbbff3e4ab39384/header.jpg?t=1759333653","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063420/1433569874/bf1afa60b46a3ab27a680af94a3b289ce514cbf2/17